{"query":"Gio Properties  official site amenities","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://www.liveatgio.com","title":"Home - Gio - Sacramento, CA","content":"We have an optimized web accessible version of this site available. Click here to view.\n\nGio\nGio\n\n# Uncommon Amenities with a Cohesive Design Style.\n\nTucked just south of the El Dorado Freeway, only 2 blocks from the UC Davis Medical Center, is your new home at Gio Apartments. Here at Gio, we take design seriously; enter through our classically accented exterior to be welcomed with tall ceilings and clean lines that offer a wonderful breath of space. Our Resident Lounge has as many spaces to connect as to find your own quiet corner, so no matter your mood, we have something to fit. A fitness center with several weight, cardio, and cable machines anchors our ground floor, and a heavenly rooftop pool and spa offers panoramic views where you can relax and reset. [...] ## Amenities for Connection, or a Space All your Own.\n\nSomething you’ll notice about our resident lounge and rooftop pool is that, even in a single space, there are smaller areas carved out that allow you the freedom to connect or the space to rest in solitude. A fitness center, outdoor courtyard, and picnic space with gas grills, you can location hop for hours without even leaving the grounds. Browse these and all of our amenities at our Amenities page below and wander the grounds yourself with our 3D virtual tours.\n\n## Pets are Family. [...] Gio’s studio, 1, 2, and 3-bedroom floor plans offer something to fit everyone, with clean, minimalist interiors that serve as the ideal backdrop for your personal style. Two kitchen color palettes and stainless-steel appliances complement hard-surface quartz counters, and LVT flooring covers your living spaces while plush carpets in the bedroom make getting out of bed just a little softer. Wander your new space with our virtual tours or reach out to our friendly leasing team to learn more about Gio – we’re here to make your move a truly positive experience.\n\n## Community Amenities\n\n## Apartment Features\n\n\\ In Select Apartment Homes\n\n## Featured Interiors\n\n## Amenities for Connection, or a Space All your Own.\n\n## Amenities for Connection, or a Space All your Own.","score":0.7507177,"raw_content":null,"id":"23a3d8-00"},{"url":"https://www.thegio.com/faqs","title":"Frequently Asked Questions | The Gio Apartments Philadelphia","content":"Amenities and Facilities · Fully-equipped Fitness Center · Resident Lounge · Rooftop Deck · Skyline Views · Secured Resident Parking · Bike Storage · Package Receiving","score":0.7092009,"raw_content":null,"id":"730b33-01"},{"url":"https://www.booking.com/hotel/hr/gio.html","title":"Apartment Giò, Tar (updated prices 2026)","content":"Modern Amenities: Guests enjoy air-conditioning, a fully equipped kitchen, washing machine, and free on-site private parking. Additional amenities include a","score":0.70871735,"raw_content":null,"id":"dc4474-02"},{"url":"https://www.har.com/gio/apartment_6882A","title":"Gio Apartments, Plano, TX 75074 - HAR.com","content":"Welcome to Gio Apartments, where luxury meets convenience in the heart of Plano, TX. Discover a world of comfort and style as you step into our modern apartments, featuring spacious floor plans, high-end finishes, and designer touches. Each residence boasts gourmet kitchens with stainless steel appliances, sleek quartz countertops, and custom cabinetry. Our community offers a wealth of amenities, including a resort-style swimming pool, a state-of-the-art fitness center, and an inviting outdoor grilling and lounge area, perfect for entertaining friends. Situated at 1800 E Spring Creek Pkwy, Gio provides easy access to major highways, placing shopping, dining, and entertainment options just a short drive away. Choose among 18 distinct floor plans with 1, 2, and 3-bedroom options, each [...] ## Unit Amenities\n\n## Fees\n\n## Sound